{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52915","headline":"炼丹井 · 李白","name":"炼丹井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻说神仙晋葛洪，炼丹曾此占云峰。\n庭前废井今犹在，不见长松见短松。\n（见《宛陵郡志备要》卷一。\n又见嘉庆《宁国府志》卷二四）（〖1〗《李白在安徽》云：井在九华山卧云庵北面。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}